# Regenerated on every `mix ex_tauri.dev`. In dev it is a shell shim holding this
# machine's absolute project path; in a production build it is a Burrito binary.
/burrito_out

# Build output from tailwind + esbuild (`mix assets.build`). The genuinely-source
# assets next to these — favicon.ico, images/, robots.txt — stay tracked.
# NOTE: because these are not committed, anything assembling a release must build
# them first. See docs/superpowers/2026-07-30-follow-ups.md.
/priv/static/assets/

# Digest cache written by `phx.digest` during `mix assets.deploy`.
/priv/static/cache_manifest.json
